AGI bonus = <math>5*\sqrt{quality/10}</math>

==Quality==

* [[{{PAGENAME}}]] Quality = <math>\frac{_{q}Block + _{q}Claws+ _{q}Leather+ _{q}Glue}{4}</math> and is [[softcap|softcapped]] by <math>\sqrt[3]{Dexterity*Sewing*Survival}</math>.
* Damage scales with strength and weapon quality using the following formula: <math>Damage = 4*\sqrt{\sqrt{Strength*{q}Gloves}/10}</math>.

